---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { caseStudies, caseStudyDisclosure, getCaseStudyHref } from "../../data/caseStudies";
import { experiments } from "../../data/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Work"
  description="Tony Pang 的脱敏企业产品案例，以及与主业分开呈现的公开技术实验。"
>
  <header class="page-intro">
    <div>
      <p class="identity-line">Work / Product judgment index</p>
      <h1>主业案例在前，公开实验在后。</h1>
    </div>
    <p class="lede">
      企业产品案例用于呈现问题、约束与决策；公开仓库只作为独立实验，不再代替主业证据。
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="enterprise-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 id="enterprise-title">Selected product work</h2>
      <p>三个案例来自企业产品设计工作，经脱敏后重新组织为可公开阅读的判断记录。</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="index-list">
      {caseStudies.map((study) => (
        <li class="index-item">
          <a class="index-link" href={getCaseStudyHref(study)}>{study.shortTitle} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <p class="index-description">{study.summary}</p>
          <span class="index-meta">{study.status}</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="boundary-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 id="boundary-title">公开边界</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>{caseStudyDisclosure}</p>
      <p>案例只呈现可迁移的产品方法与决策结构，不提供内部文件、客户数据、商业信息、实施计划或未经确认的效果数字。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="public-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 id="public-title">Experiments / Side projects</h2>
      <p>早期公开练习，可检查源代码，但不代表当前主业方向或企业产品能力。</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="index-list">
      {experiments.map((project) => (
        <li class="index-item">
          <a class="index-link" href={project.href}>{project.name} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <p class="index-description">{project.description}</p>
          <span class="index-meta">{project.meta}</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="evidence-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 id="evidence-title">证据规则</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>每个 Case Study 都说明背景、问题、约束、工作范围、关键决策、舍弃方案、证据类型与当前状态。没有经过确认的结果，就不写结果；无法公开，就明确边界。</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">讨论一个具体问题 →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
